ips do the work; arms are just ropes.","Hinge back and hike the weight between your thighs.","Finish tall, ribs down, glutes tight."]},"squat":{"wrong":["Knees cave inward.","Chest drops forward and the heels lift.","Dropping fast and bouncing out of the bottom."],"right":["Hips back, then down, with control.","Knees track out over your toes, whole foot on the floor.","Chest up, push the floor away to stand."]},"lunge":{"wrong":["Leaning the chest far forward.","Front knee diving past your toes or caving in.","Short, rushed steps with no control."],"right":["Upright torso, ribs stacked over hips.","Front knee tracks over the middle of your foot.","Lower straight down, then push through the front heel."]},"stairs":{"wrong":["Only the toes land on the step.","Pushing off the back foot instead of the front leg.","Rushing down, which is hard on the knees."],"right":["Whole foot on each step.","Drive up through the front heel; use the rail.","Stand tall and take the way down slowly."]},"calf":{"wrong":["Bouncing the rep with no pause.","Leaning forward to get the weight up.","Cutting the range short at the top and bottom."],"right":["Rise slowly onto the balls of your feet.","Pause at the top and squeeze.","Lower all the way until you feel a stretch."]},"walk":{"wrong":["Hunched forward, gripping the rails.","Short, stomping steps.","Looking down at your feet."],"right":["Stand tall, light hands, eyes forward.","Roll heel to toe with even steps.","Swing your arms and keep a pace you can talk at."]},"carry":{"wrong":["Leaning to one side or slouching forward.","Shrugging the weight up.","Rushing with long, bouncing steps."],"right":["Stand tall, ribs down, shoulders down and back.","Small, steady steps; eyes forward.","Squeeze the handles, arms still."]},"row":{"wrong":["Rounded back.","Heaving the weight with momentum.","Standing up as you pull."],"right":["Flat back and the same hinge angle all the way.","Pull toward your hip, elbows back.","Pause, then lower slowly."]},"curl":{"wrong":["Swinging your back to get it up.","Elbows drifting forward.","Dropping the weight instead of lowering it."],"right":["Elbows pinned at your sides.","Curl up, squeeze, and lower for 2 to 3 seconds.","Stay tall; the weight only moves at the elbow."]},"ohpress":{"wrong":["Leaning back and arching your lower back.","Pressing in front of you instead of overhead.","Flaring your ribs."],"right":["Ribs down, glutes and abs tight.","Press straight up and finish with your biceps by your ears.","Lower under control to the shoulders."]},"raise":{"wrong":["Swinging the weight up with your body.","Raising your arms above shoulder height.","Shrugging toward your ears."],"right":["Smooth lift to shoulder height only.","Slight bend in the elbows; lead with the elbows.","Lower slowly; keep your shoulders down."]},"pushdown":{"wrong":["Elbows drifting forward and away from your sides.","Leaning over the cable to push.","Letting the weight snap back up."],"right":["Elbows pinned at your sides.","Push down until your arms are straight and squeeze.","Let the handle rise slowly, no higher than your chest."]},"shrug":{"wrong":["Rolling the shoulders in circles.","Pushing your head forward.","Jerking the weight up."],"right":["Lift straight up toward your ears.","Pause for a second at the top.","Lower slowly; keep your neck long."]},"reach":{"wrong":["Arching your lower back to reach higher.","Shrugging toward your ears.","Holding your breath or bouncing."],"right":["Ribs down, reach tall.","Shoulders relaxed, away from your ears.","Hold steady and breathe slowly."]},"lean":{"wrong":["Heel lifting off the floor.","Bouncing in the stretch.","Rounding your back to get closer."],"right":["Heel stays down; lean in from the hips.","Hold still and breathe.","Back straight; stop at a firm stretch, not pain."]},"seatPress":{"wrong":["Shoulders rolling forward off the pad.","Locking the elbows hard at the top.","Letting the weight crash back."],"right":["Back flat on the pad, shoulder blades pinched.","Press forward, stopping just short of lock-out.","Return slowly under control."]},"seatOH":{"wrong":["Arching your back off the pad.","Pressing the weight out in front.","Dropping the weight fast."],"right":["Back against the pad, ribs down.","Press straight up, elbows just short of lock-out.","Lower slowly to shoulder height."]},"seatRow":{"wrong":["Rocking your whole body back and forth.","Shrugging your shoulders up.","Rounding your upper back."],"right":["Sit tall and stay still from the hips up.","Pull your elbows back and squeeze your shoulder blades.","Reach forward slowly; keep your chest up."]},"pulldown":{"wrong":["Leaning far back and swinging the bar down.","Pulling the bar behind your neck.","Shrugging your shoulders up."],"right":["Lean back slightly and keep it steady.","Pull to your upper chest, elbows down and back.","Control the bar on the way up."]},"legExt":{"wrong":["Swinging the weight with momentum.","Lifting your hips off the seat.","Locking out hard and slamming the stack."],"right":["Back and hips stay against the pad.","Extend smoothly and squeeze your thighs.","Lower for 2 to 3 seconds."]},"legCurl":{"wrong":["Hips lifting or rocking.","Jerking the weight up.","Cutting the range short."],"right":["Hips stay down against the pad.","Curl smoothly and squeeze the back of your legs.","Return slowly with control."]},"seatCalf":{"wrong":["Bouncing the rep.","Rushing the lowering part.","Stopping short at the top."],"right":["Press up onto the balls of your feet.","Pause and squeeze at the top.","Lower all the way for a full stretch."]},"legPress":{"wrong":["Hips curling off the pad at the bottom.","Knees collapsing inward.","Locking your knees hard at the top."],"right":["Lower back and hips stay on the pad.","Knees track in line with your toes.","Press through your whole foot; stop just short of lock-out."]},"pedal":{"wrong":["Hunched over the bars.","Seat too low so your knees bunch up.","Gripping hard and bouncing in the saddle."],"right":["Sit tall with a relaxed upper body.","Seat height so your knee is slightly bent at the bottom.","Smooth circles; push and pull evenly."]},"seatFold":{"wrong":["Rounding your back to reach your toes.","Bouncing in the stretch.","Locking your knee hard."],"right":["Hinge forward from the hips with a flat back.","Reach only as far as you can with a straight back.","Hold still and breathe."]},"benchPress":{"wrong":["Hips lifting and the lower back arching high.","Bouncing the weight off your chest.","Wrists bent back under the weight."],"right":["Feet planted, shoulder blades pinched, back flat.","Lower with control to mid-chest and press up.","Wrists stacked over elbows, elbows about 45°."]},"pullover":{"wrong":["Arching your back as the weight goes back.","Bending your elbows too much.","Dropping the weight too far behind you."],"right":["Ribs down, back flat on the bench.","Slight bend in the elbows and keep it fixed.","Move only as far as your shoulders allow."]},"skull":{"wrong":["Elbows flaring or drifting back.","Using your shoulders to swing the weight.","Lowering fast toward your face."],"right":["Upper arms stay still and vertical.","Bend only at the elbows.","Lower slowly, then extend and squeeze."]},"crunch":{"wrong":["Pulling on your neck with your hands.","Swinging up with momentum.","Lifting your lower back off the floor."],"right":["Curl your ribs toward your hips.","Chin off your chest, eyes on the ceiling.","Exhale up, lower slowly."]},"legRaise":{"wrong":["Lower back arching off the floor.","Swinging the legs with momentum.","Dropping the legs fast."],"right":["Press your lower back into the floor.","Raise and lower slowly with control.","Bend your knees to make it easier, not your back."]},"pushup":{"wrong":["Hips sagging toward the floor.","Elbows flared straight out.","Head dropping and the neck craning."],"right":["Straight line from head to heels.","Elbows about 45° from your body.","Neck neutral, eyes just ahead of your hands."]},"pullup":{"wrong":["Kipping and swinging your legs for momentum.","Craning your chin over the bar.","Dropping fast from the top."],"right":["Start from a controlled hang, shoulders down.","Pull your chest toward the bar, elbows down.","Lower slowly through the full range."]},"dips":{"wrong":["Dropping so low your shoulders strain.","Shoulders shrugging up to your ears.","Leaning far forward and flaring the elbows."],"right":["Shoulders down, chest up.","Lower until your elbows are about 90°.","Press up smoothly; stop just before lock-out."]},"getup":{"wrong":["Rushing and kipping up with momentum.","Looking down at your body so the fist wanders.","Letting the arm drift forward."],"right":["Slow, with your eyes on your fist.","Arm stays straight over your shoulder.","Press the floor away with the elbow, then lower with control."]},"stretch":{"wrong":["Bouncing in the stretch.","Holding your breath.","Pushing into sharp pain."],"right":["Ease in until you feel a gentle pull.","Hold still and breathe slowly.","Keep your shoulders relaxed, away from your ears."]}}}